<launch-intro id="launch-intro" />
<view class="page"><state-view loading="{{loading}}" error="{{error && !booking ? error : ''}}" bind:retry="reload"/><block wx:if="{{shop}}"><view class="shop-note"><text class="eyebrow">{{shop.zoneLabel}} · 同窗工作室</text><view class="title">{{shop.name}}</view><view class="content caption">{{shop.description}}</view><view class="between caption"><text>主理人 {{shop.ownerNickname}}</text><text>{{shop.openingHours || '预约时间可协商'}}</text></view></view><view wx:if="{{bookingDone}}" class="notice">预约已发送，可到「通行证 → 我的预约」查看进度。</view><view class="contacts" wx:if="{{contacts.length}}"><button wx:for="{{contacts}}" wx:key="label" class="small plain" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="copyContact">{{item.label}}</button></view><view wx:else class="disabled-note">提交预约后展示主理人联系方式；请先确认服务要求。</view><view class="section-title">这家店能帮你</view><view class="service" wx:for="{{services}}" wx:key="id"><view class="between"><text class="pill blue">{{item.categoryLabel}}</text><text class="caption">约 {{item.durationMinutes}} 分钟</text></view><view class="heading service-title">{{item.title}}</view><view class="content caption">{{item.description}}</view><view class="between service-bottom"><view><text class="service-price mono-num">¥{{item.priceLabel}}</text><text class="caption"> / {{item.priceUnit}}</text></view><button class="small" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="openBooking">预约这项服务</button></view></view><state-view empty="{{!services.length}}" title="主理人正在整理服务" description="目前没有可预约的服务项目。" /></block></view>
<bottom-sheet id="booking-sheet" visible="{{booking}}" title="预约同学的服务" busy="{{busy}}" bind:close="closeBooking"><view class="field"><text class="field-label">选择服务</text><picker range="{{services}}" range-key="title" value="{{serviceIndex}}" data-field="serviceIndex" bindchange="field"><view class="picker">{{services[serviceIndex].title}}</view></picker></view><view class="field"><text class="field-label">期望时间</text><view class="date-grid"><picker mode="date" value="{{date}}" data-field="date" bindchange="field"><view class="picker">{{date}}</view></picker><picker mode="time" value="{{time}}" data-field="time" bindchange="field"><view class="picker">{{time}}</view></picker></view></view><view class="field"><text class="field-label">一句话说说需求</text><textarea value="{{note}}" data-field="note" bindinput="field" maxlength="1000" placeholder="如：电脑型号、约拍风格、方便联系的时段" /></view><view class="notice">参考价 ¥{{services[serviceIndex].priceLabel}} / {{services[serviceIndex].priceUnit}}。具体费用由双方确认并直接结算，本次不会扣款。</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view><view slot="footer"><button class="primary" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="submitBooking">发送预约，等待主理人确认</button></view></bottom-sheet>
